## Why This Is Asked
Tests CISSP-aligned decision-making in multi-cloud ML environments handling PII, focusing on practical containment, recovery, and governance beyond generic security concepts.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-cloud data governance with Databricks Unity Catalog, AWS, GCP, and OpenAI
- Fine-grained access control: ABAC, row-level policies, Just-In-Time elevation
- Incident containment: credential rotation, workspace isolation, audit trails, data provenance

## Code Example
```javascript
// Conceptual policy check (simplified)
if (hasRole('data-producer') && withinWindow('now','09:00')) {
  grantAccess(' pii-dataset ');
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical CISSP application to real-world, multi-region auth flows, highlighting threat modeling, token lifecycle, and IR readiness.

## Key Concepts
- STRIDE/PASTA for auth/session threats
- JWT, PKCE, JWKS, token rotation, revocation
- mTLS, RBAC/ABAC in a multi-region service mesh
- IR playbooks and testing strategy

## Code Example
```javascript
// Token validation sketch
function validateToken(token, jwks) {
  const payload = decode(token);
  if (payload.iss !== expectedIssuer) return false;
  if (payload.exp < Date.now()/1000) return false;
  // signature verify against jwks...
  return true;
}
```

